{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dread Meridian is an original VR survival horror inspired by Lovecraft's &quot;At the Mountains of Madness&quot;, set in Oglanbyen\u2019s frozen wasteland.  As Daniela, you search for your twin while facing betrayal and mutated researchers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843700/extras/614fc32156ea335cafc27410ac2aa918.avif?t=1769181177\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843700/extras_big/614fc32156ea335cafc27410ac2aa918.webp?t=1769181177 width=1560 height=73 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your wits against the twisted creatures that stalk the lands. Planning is key to survival on the lost island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843700/extras/755caab49c763fda629518592e7164f4.poster.avif?t=1769181177\" width=1170 height=489 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843700/extras/755caab49c763fda629518592e7164f4.webm?t=1769181177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843700/extras/c46d9a9bd088a3c68adbc689dd2a1f87.avif?t=1769181177\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843700/extras_big/c46d9a9bd088a3c68adbc689dd2a1f87.webp?t=1769181177 width=1560 height=73 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the dread-filled Oglanbyen, where you never know what could be around the next corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843700/extras/05796bcb7a96db7ed93f3cdbbafb4ea1.poster.avif?t=1769181177\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843700/extras/05796bcb7a96db7ed93f3cdbbafb4ea1.webm?t=1769181177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843700/extras/05796bcb7a96db7ed93f3cdbbafb4ea1.mp4?t=1769181177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843700/extras/88b834408aa2fd9a73607b3db5224012.avif?t=1769181177\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843700/extras_big/88b834408aa2fd9a73607b3db5224012.webp?t=1769181177 width=1560 height=73 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge ammo and supplies to survive the island's hostile inhabitants. Customize your weapon with salvaged attachments. When all else fails, rely on your trusty knife and fight to your last breath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843700/extras/d6ad3017d9a1d027a57344a0f77cff02.poster.avif?t=1769181177\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843700/extras/d6ad3017d9a1d027a57344a0f77cff02.webm?t=1769181177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843700/extras/d6ad3017d9a1d027a57344a0f77cff